      "leadSummary": "Classical and quantum scattering theory of the Raman effect, polarizability tensors and ellipsoids, Rayleigh vs Stokes/anti-Stokes scattering, temperature-dependent intensity ratios, pure rotational Raman spectra (4B and 6B spacing), vibrational Raman selection rules, depolarization ratios, rule of mutual exclusion in centrosymmetric molecules, resonance Raman, and Surface-Enhanced Raman Scattering (SERS).",
