      "leadSummary": "Electronic states and term symbols of diatomic molecules, vibronic coarse structure and progression manifolds, Franck-Condon principle and vibrational overlap integrals, Birge-Sponer extrapolation to excited state dissociation limits, rotational fine structure and Fortrat parabolas, electronic spectrum of H2, chromophores and auxochromes, solvatochromism, and spectrophotometric analysis.",
