      "leadSummary": "Physical principles of Electron Spin Resonance (ESR/EPR), electron Zeeman interaction, g-tensor anisotropy, isotropic and anisotropic hyperfine coupling, McConnell relation for radical spin densities, transition metal zero-field splitting, spin labeling, Mössbauer recoil-free fraction, isomer shift, electric quadrupole splitting, and magnetic hyperfine Zeeman splitting.",
